      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, both implementations should expose the same UAPI.\nI also don\u0027t like exposing this driver-specific interface inside `/sys/kernel/mm`. Can we accomplish this using `module_param`? That would move this control under `/sys/module/ashmem/parameters/`.",
